# Input
```css
/* should generate diagnostics */
a { font-weight: 400; }
a { font-weight: 700; }
a { font-weight: 400.0; }
a { font: italic small-caps 700 16px/3 cursive; }
a { font: normal 400 normal 16px serif; }
a { font: 400 normal 16px serif; }
a { font: 400 16px serif; }
@font-face { font-weight: 400 700; }

```

